<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Higuchi returns three days after her first visit for her results and is seen by Dr. Abernathy-Okoye of infectious diseases today. She brought the second and third sputum specimens, the last collected on waking this morning. Since her first visit she has stayed home, slept in her own room with the window open, and worn a surgical mask in the shared rooms; no one has visited. The cough is unchanged, with a little white sputum and no blood, and she still has evening fevers and night sweats. She is eating a little more since the dietitian&apos;s first call. She has not written since her first visit. She is worried about the people she lives with and about the cost of treatment. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Cough, evening fevers and night sweats unchanged; no hemoptysis</td></tr><tr><td>Precautions</td><td>At home with a mask in shared rooms; no visitors</td></tr><tr><td>Testing</td><td>Three sputum specimens complete; blood results back</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

