    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Cough with a little white sputum; no blood; breathless on the stairs</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Evening fevers, night sweats and tiredness</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No blurred vision</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Worried about her household and costs; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

